OL,3,GNEWSAIsland 'could become hub' for
OL,4,AAtlantic tuna exports
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey's fishing and hospitality
OL,7,Findustries have welcomed the move by
OL,8,Fthe island's government towards
OL,9,Fgranting commercial licences for
OL,10,Fcatching and landing Atlantic blue fin
OL,11,Ftuna.
OL,13,FDeputies have approved measures to
OL,14,Fensure Guernsey complies with the
OL,15,FInternational Convention for the
OL,16,FConservation of Atlantic Tunas, which
OL,17,Fwould allow Guernsey to be a part of
OL,18,Fthe England's quota system.
OL,20,FSkipper Nigel du Jardin said it was
OL,21,F"encouraging news" for a "dying"
OL,22,Ffishing industry.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
