OL,3,GNEWSAIsland 'could become hub' for
OL,4,AAtlantic tuna exports
OL,5,
OL,6,FSam Jarrold, owner of Sushi restaurant
OL,7,FFukku, said that, if the process was
OL,8,F"done right", Guernsey could become a
OL,9,Fhub for export.
